This package (@phpretro/plugin-project-companion) is part of the PHPRetro builder
and is licensed GPL-3.0-only, matching the companion builder package it talks to.

It links against the upstream elizaOS host packages (@elizaos/agent, @elizaos/core,
@elizaos/host) pinned at commit 28fef47c9d9d3acc7792be0fdaa3070020293cc5, which are
licensed MIT. No upstream source file is copied or modified by this package; the
host APIs are consumed as peer dependencies.
